<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka issues four-year rupee treasury bonds.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka issues four-year rupee treasury bonds.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's Central Bank gave the following details of its 500 million rupee four-year treasury bond issue on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	  Amount offered:	500 million rupees</p>
<p>	  Bids received:	 755 million rupees</p>
<p>	  Amount accepted:     500 million rupees</p>
<p>	  Weighted avg yield:  12.25 percent per year</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
